# apps/web is formatted by BIOME, not prettier, and the two disagree:
# apps/web/biome.json sets indentStyle "tab" and the tree uses double quotes,
# while the root .prettierrc sets singleQuote and prettier defaults to spaces.
# CI runs BOTH (`nx format:check` and `nx run-many -t lint`), so leaving this
# tree to prettier made the two steps mutually unsatisfiable — 131 of the 169
# files `format:check` flagged were apps/web files that biome had just
# formatted correctly.
/apps/web

